6
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:29,980
We now officially open Part 1: "The Paradigm Shift: From Waiting Chatbots to Sleep-Free Personal Avatars."

7
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:43,300
Professor Kim, I love the comparison on this slide! On the left, we have 'The Traditional Coder' who spends hours typing raw code line by line, constantly wrestling with typos and syntax bugs.

8
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:58,760
Yes! And on the right, we have 'The Intelligence Architect.' Instead of writing every semicolon manually, the Architect orchestrates Coder, Reviewer, and Tester agents running concurrently.

