20
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:36,700
When Data, Technology, and Life OS align, you become an unstoppable, balanced Intelligence Architect!

21
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:50,820
Sarah, remember when we were kids doing endless homework drills? We all had that exact same wish on Slide 5!

22
00:04:51,520 --> 00:05:00,760
Oh, absolutely! "What if I had a twin robot who could organize my desk, do my math worksheets, and clean my room while I played outside?"

23
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:12,640
Exactly! It sounded like pure sci-fi back then. But look at the right card: in 2026, it is our everyday reality.

24
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:25,630
It truly is. Our Autonomous Avatars now read emails, summarize PDF research papers, run Python data scripts, and file receipts into Google Drive automatically overnight.

25
00:05:26,330 --> 00:05:32,040
What was once a child's daydream is now an indispensable professional superpower.

26
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:46,620
Slide 6 reveals a sobering truth: What is the single most valuable currency in human existence? It is not money; it is Attention and Time.

27
