28
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:11,370
But with the Agentic Architecture we are teaching, you can offload up to 80% of routine cognitive friction—like sorting spreadsheets and filtering junk emails—directly to your avatar.

29
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:22,700
And that gives you a 10x Strategic Leverage! You can spend your reclaimed energy on high-level strategy, deep relationships, and creative mastery.

30
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:28,820
That is why learning this course is an investment in your life, not just your tech resume.

31
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:39,550
Let us review our road map for today's 60-minute lecture on Slide 7.

32
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:51,000
We have three major milestones! First, we will master the Paradigm Shift—clarifying the crucial difference between old synchronous chatbots and autonomous avatars.

33
00:06:51,700 --> 00:07:02,960
Second, we will dive deep into the Engine Architecture—exploring the 3-layer Spark pipeline powered by Google's lightning-fast Gemini 3.5 Flash model.

34
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:13,260
